cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "SEAGRAMMAR — frozen framework, evaluation protocol, baselines and sealed benchmark"
message: "If you use this registration or its code, please cite it."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Pham
    given-names: Huong
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6896-133X"
date-released: 2026-09-07
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Registered deliverable D0.1 of the SEAGRAMMAR project: a frozen rule-learning
  framework for predicting bacterial biotransformation of seagrass metabolites
  from recurring substructures, together with its evaluation protocol, its three
  baselines, and the identities of six sealed hold-out compounds. Registered
  before any experimental data exist. All pilot metrics are rule recovery on
  simulated labels, not measurements.
keywords:
  - metabolomics
  - biotransformation
  - Zostera marina
  - pre-registration
  - substructure rules
